#. type: Title #
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sentry integration"
msgstr "Integração com o Sentry"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is Sentry"
msgstr "O que é o Sentry"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Sentry](https://sentry.io/) is a tool for monitoring and debugging application stability and performance.\n"
"Sentry gives you access to the events that you send there from your application.\n"
msgstr ""
"O [Sentry](https://sentry.io/) é uma ferramenta para monitorar e depurar a estabilidade e o desempenho de aplicações.\n"
"O Sentry dá acesso aos eventos que você envia para ele a partir da sua aplicação.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
msgid "Most often, Sentry is used for monitoring errors (exceptions).  You can enrich errors with context to better understand the problem: - Request arguments - Tags for grouping exceptions - Environment state: environment variables, application state, and other global attributes"
msgstr "Na maioria das vezes, o Sentry é usado para monitorar erros (exceções).  Você pode enriquecer os erros com contexto para entender melhor o problema: - Argumentos da requisição - Tags para agrupar exceções - Estado do ambiente: variáveis de ambiente, estado da aplicação e outros atributos globais"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
msgid "You can find the full list of features on the official website: https://sentry.io/welcome/"
msgstr "Você encontra a lista completa de funcionalidades no site oficial: https://sentry.io/welcome/"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the package"
msgstr "Instale o pacote"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
msgid "Install the required package `yiisoft/yii-sentry` with the following command:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote necessário `yiisoft/yii-sentry` com o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Fenced code block (shell)
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "composer require yiisoft/yii-sentry --prefer-dist\n"
msgstr "composer require yiisoft/yii-sentry --prefer-dist\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install an HTTP driver"
msgstr "Instale um driver HTTP"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
msgid "The [`getsentry/sentry-php`](https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-php) library requires the `php-http/httplug` package and any HTTP driver.  In the example below we’ll use the Guzzle adapter."
msgstr "A biblioteca [`getsentry/sentry-php`](https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-php) exige o pacote `php-http/httplug` e algum driver HTTP.  No exemplo abaixo, vamos usar o adaptador do Guzzle."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "> You can find the list of all adapters on [this page](https://docs.php-http.org/en/latest/clients.html#clients-adapters).\n"
msgstr "> Você encontra a lista de todos os adaptadores [nesta página](https://docs.php-http.org/en/latest/clients.html#clients-adapters).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
msgid "To install the packages, run the following command:"
msgstr "Para instalar os pacotes, execute o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Fenced code block (shell)
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "composer require php-http/httplug php-http/guzzle7-adapter --prefer-dist\n"
msgstr "composer require php-http/httplug php-http/guzzle7-adapter --prefer-dist\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md ../src/en/guide/concept/configuration.md ../src/en/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md ../src/en/guide/views/view-injections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get and store the token"
msgstr "Obtenha e guarde o token"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
msgid "Next, configure the application."
msgstr "Em seguida, configure a aplicação."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
msgid "First, register at [Sentry](https://sentry.io) and create a project."
msgstr "Primeiro, cadastre-se no [Sentry](https://sentry.io) e crie um projeto."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
msgid "Then, in the project settings on the “General Settings” tab, find the “Security Token” field and copy its value."
msgstr "Depois, nas configurações do projeto, na aba “General Settings”, encontre o campo “Security Token” e copie o valor dele."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now put this token into the package configuration. By default, the config is located at `config/packages/yiisoft/yii-sentry/config/params.php`.\n"
"Set the copied token as the value of the array element at `yiisoft/yii-sentry` => `options` => `dsn`. Example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Agora coloque esse token na configuração do pacote. Por padrão, a configuração fica em `config/packages/yiisoft/yii-sentry/config/params.php`.\n"
"Defina o token copiado como valor do elemento do array em `yiisoft/yii-sentry` => `options` => `dsn`. Exemplo:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (diff)
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"'yiisoft/yii-sentry' => [\n"
"    'enabled' => true,\n"
"    'options' => [\n"
"-        'dsn' => '',\n"
"+        'dsn' => 'TOKEN',\n"
"    ],\n"
"],\n"
msgstr ""
"'yiisoft/yii-sentry' => [\n"
"    'enabled' => true,\n"
"    'options' => [\n"
"-        'dsn' => '',\n"
"+        'dsn' => 'TOKEN',\n"
"    ],\n"
"],\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the HTTP client"
msgstr "Configure o cliente HTTP"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
msgid "After installing the HTTP client, configure it."
msgstr "Depois de instalar o cliente HTTP, configure-o."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
msgid "Create the file `config/common/sentry.php` and put the following code into it:"
msgstr "Crie o arquivo `config/common/sentry.php` e coloque nele o seguinte código:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    \\Http\\Client\\HttpClient::class => \\GuzzleHttp\\Client::class,\n"
"    \\Http\\Client\\HttpAsyncClient::class => [\n"
"        'class' => \\Http\\Adapter\\Guzzle7\\Client::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            \\Yiisoft\\Factory\\Definition\\Reference::to(\\Http\\Client\\HttpClient::class),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    \\Http\\Client\\HttpClient::class => \\GuzzleHttp\\Client::class,\n"
"    \\Http\\Client\\HttpAsyncClient::class => [\n"
"        'class' => \\Http\\Adapter\\Guzzle7\\Client::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            \\Yiisoft\\Factory\\Definition\\Reference::to(\\Http\\Client\\HttpClient::class),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Title #
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Integration"
msgstr "Integração"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Web"
msgstr "Web"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
msgid "Sentry support for `web` is implemented as middleware."
msgstr "O suporte do Sentry para `web` é implementado como middleware."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
msgid "That means you only need to add `SentryMiddleware` to the global middleware list in `config/web/application.php`:"
msgstr "Isso significa que você só precisa adicionar o `SentryMiddleware` à lista global de middlewares em `config/web/application.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (diff)
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"return [\n"
"    Yiisoft\\Yii\\Web\\Application::class => [\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'dispatcher' => DynamicReference::to(static function (Injector $injector) {\n"
"                return ($injector->make(MiddlewareDispatcher::class))\n"
"                    ->withMiddlewares(\n"
"                        [\n"
"                            Router::class,\n"
"                            SubFolder::class,\n"
"+                            SentryMiddleware::class,\n"
"                            ErrorCatcher::class,\n"
"                        ]\n"
"                    );\n"
"            }),\n"
"            'fallbackHandler' => Reference::to(NotFoundHandler::class),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"return [\n"
"    Yiisoft\\Yii\\Web\\Application::class => [\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'dispatcher' => DynamicReference::to(static function (Injector $injector) {\n"
"                return ($injector->make(MiddlewareDispatcher::class))\n"
"                    ->withMiddlewares(\n"
"                        [\n"
"                            Router::class,\n"
"                            SubFolder::class,\n"
"+                            SentryMiddleware::class,\n"
"                            ErrorCatcher::class,\n"
"                        ]\n"
"                    );\n"
"            }),\n"
"            'fallbackHandler' => Reference::to(NotFoundHandler::class),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md ../src/en/internals/003-roadmap.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Console"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
msgid "Sentry supports `console` via a handler for the [ConsoleEvents::ERROR](https://symfony.com/doc/current/components/console/events.html#the-consoleevents-error-event) event."
msgstr "O Sentry suporta o `console` por meio de um handler para o evento [ConsoleEvents::ERROR](https://symfony.com/doc/current/components/console/events.html#the-consoleevents-error-event)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/en/cookbook/sentry-integration.md
msgid "The package provides a configuration file that automatically subscribes the application to this event."
msgstr "O pacote fornece um arquivo de configuração que inscreve a aplicação nesse evento automaticamente."
